{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And He said</b> — that HaShem will remove every prosecuting adversary, so that the House will be built and the service of the Temple will be complete." "<b>Is not this one</b> — by way of parable: their suffering is sufficient for those who survived exile, or how can one prosecute him when the fire did not harm him; by way of parable, how can one prosecute him, after he was saved from exile."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:47.407806388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}